These inform public-client PKCE/token parameters, Codex endpoint/account headers,
store/include/instructions and streaming request shape. No Rust implementation,
terminal UI/Ratatui code, agent orchestration, recovery loop or credential manager
was copied. Login UX, default-path discovery, automatic refresh/retry, permissive
expiry fallback and Chat Completions bridging from Bub are excluded.

Republic uses Authlib for standard OAuth, adds strict expiry/callback validation,
secret-safe error mapping and explicit atomic token files, and reuses the existing
Responses wire conversion/parser for single-request Codex SSE generation. Native
reasoning items are retained. No claim of live account access or unchanged upstream
API/behavior compatibility is made.
